{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0234_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6c3e132341463d54fb0806424219dcc42e7ca1d30731b30dc16a38407ad10ed3", "ja": "（今日は美希のグラビア撮影。アメリカンダイナーの\nウェイトレス役との事で、役作りに協力している）", "zh": "（今天是美希的写真拍摄。听说她要饰演美式餐厅的女服务员，所以我正在帮她揣摩角色。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0234_1001_003mik", "source_sha256": "dc118a2bc183d21bccf82784a46e7867c4bb3940e60a72356fa7225e65826597", "ja": "いらっしゃいませ、{$P$}！\nミキのダイナーへようこそなの♪", "zh": "欢迎光临，{$P$}！\n欢迎来到美希的餐厅哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0234_1002_003mik", "source_sha256": "e823e458df751aca68371860fad17297f774a00728c5cc1ea92e83959199d503", "ja": "ご注文は、ミキの昼寝姿？　あふぅ……。\n{$P$}、膝まくらしてもいいよ？", "zh": "您要点的是美希的午睡模样？啊呼……。\n{$P$}，可以让你枕着我的腿哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0234_1003_p", "source_sha256": "c8c39b7d6b22bdac01a6875c14ba18ccfe9b2d882fb6222bb9c04c77ec1155d6", "ja": "あの……これって役作りだよな？\nなんか、いつも通りの美希だと思うんだけど……。", "zh": "那个……这算是在塑造角色吧？\n怎么感觉和平时的美希没什么两样啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0234_1004_003mik", "source_sha256": "219d5547cd76bad03263fc85361270e3158aa4cea356e1bad6966baa655531f4", "ja": "だから、練習するの！\nいきなりできたら、役作りしなくていいって思うな。", "zh": "所以才要练习啊！\n要是一下子就能做到，就不用塑造角色了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0234_1005_p", "source_sha256": "c30a5150640facf9ee9a94026382461fcd0ef229d98495d3ff0bb5fe19bc3cea", "ja": "う、うーん……確かに、スジは通ってるけど。", "zh": "呃，嗯……确实，你说得有道理。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0234_1006_003mik", "source_sha256": "fb7cdda4bc2a3859df7440fc812c4816e0446a9423cd550ef6ccb5696b758414", "ja": "でしょでしょ？　{$P$}も、\nちゃんとお客さんになりきってね。", "zh": "对吧对吧？{$P$}也要好好演成客人哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0234_1007_p", "source_sha256": "b06efc80b7ec434eff85cedf73160383d4054a5d354dcc113a343d3f03ca9140", "ja": "まあ、撮影のためならいくらでも協力するけど。\n美希も真剣にやろうな！", "zh": "行吧，只要是为了拍摄，我全力配合就是了。\n美希也要认真起来哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0234_1008_003mik", "source_sha256": "8bab398c662f21274d5e389294ce3012de234d50bced17539589c8e197042647", "ja": "はーいなの。じゃあ……はい、これ！\nスペシャルメニューね。", "zh": "好——那么……来，这个给你！\n特别菜单哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0234_1009", "source_sha256": "72581708f4a5c9f944f2121956fbfb746fd61b265cb305e76f64a4a968f4a7f8", "ja": "受け取る", "zh": "收下", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0234_2000_p", "source_sha256": "5e2ab2df4ba472585a728ffdce1424089e40460fb4f832abc3082beacfd09853", "ja": "なになに……『ミキにおにぎりを食べさせる権』？\n『ミキといちごババロアを一緒に食べる権』！？", "zh": "什么什么……“喂美希吃饭团的权利”？\n“和美希一起吃草莓巴伐利亚布丁的权利”？！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0234_2001_003mik", "source_sha256": "afbc83115159597075343e84a0a6dace79255265e81edb5bd174f8b324679904", "ja": "{$P$}だけの裏メニューなの♪\n好きなのを選んでいいよ？", "zh": "这是只属于{$P$}的隐藏菜单哦♪\n你可以挑喜欢的选哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0234_2002_p", "source_sha256": "c2ed47948327588d15df090c17e929c81709682d47efad5f4bfaf06e4ac18d99", "ja": "うーん、なんかちょっと……方向性が違わないか？", "zh": "嗯——总觉得有点……方向不太对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0234_2003_003mik", "source_sha256": "00c95d45cb2d774daaeed1dee34b28680224e6ca1b1b017e298c425241d9d19c", "ja": "そんなことないって思うな。{$P$}と\n好きなものを一緒に食べたら、ミキもうれしいもん！", "zh": "我觉得不是那样呀。和{$P$}一起\n吃喜欢的东西，美希也会很开心嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0234_2004_003mik", "source_sha256": "953896d3df88f6a8b6d1bd46a6c4998d8350c18e1b1177f1c5fb017a988e6a68", "ja": "もしかして、{$P$}は違うの？\nミキと一緒はうれしくない？　ふーん、そうなんだ。", "zh": "难道说，{$P$}不一样吗？\n和美希一起就不开心吗？哼，原来是这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0234_2005_p", "source_sha256": "5d0a655d3370e9208afa732a027eb3fd034e38742076fb4872128c1c5fdb7095", "ja": "い、いや、そういう話じゃなくて……。", "zh": "不、不是这个意思……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0234_2006_003mik", "source_sha256": "81d5528c11942d08069e8062fd541bcd6a65551a24ab6c4d4f3dcab6ad4d55b8", "ja": "ウェイトレスさんは、おもてなしの心が\n一番大事って聞いたんだけど。", "zh": "我听说，对女服务员来说，待客之心是最重要的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0234_2007_p", "source_sha256": "3c90aa10c6539958cc6de9f0e71df54cbc8b6354bfc6946f2be85ded46bc5130", "ja": "確かに、そうだけど……。\n取り敢えず、食べ物のメニューにしようか。", "zh": "确实是这样，不过……\n先来想想食物菜单吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0234_2008_003mik", "source_sha256": "15bf21dd9e0d977f9637d158f31c5b3231054f8fab43bfaa2465d2ee9713c647", "ja": "そっか。ちょっと考えてみるね。\nうーん、と……あっ、わかったの！　それじゃあ……。", "zh": "这样啊。我稍微想想吧。\n嗯……让我想想……啊，想到了！那就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0234_2009_003mik", "source_sha256": "ecd8e07b676d3ecafcd4f25395a398f641e800964d7950c228d6b1836f8958f3", "ja": "『あとでこっそりハニーを独り占めしちゃう権』\n……とか？", "zh": "『之后偷偷独占Honey权』\n……怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0234_2010_p", "source_sha256": "d9ce67842afc3afa3d3586c14d3353550ba78f4643f6695a99c3cc8c88286dd3", "ja": "あ、こら！\n仕事中にハニーって呼ぶのはダメだって……！", "zh": "啊，喂！  \n都说了工作的时候不可以叫“亲爱的”……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0234_2011_003mik", "source_sha256": "ea115c023ccef06195e90908191e4786ef9acee45cd241924c2a01fdef6227ac", "ja": "あはっ。ごめんね、{$P$}！\nちょっとイタズラしたくて。", "zh": "啊哈哈。对不起嘛，{$P$}！\n人家只是想恶作剧一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0234_2012_003mik", "source_sha256": "ffabe02df170f490ad7853afe5f36f4d87c78e68bd460247cc630d5c2c37d24e", "ja": "だけど……ミキ、冗談でこんなこと言わないよ？\n本気で、独り占めしたいって思ってるから……。", "zh": "可是……美希才不会拿这种事开玩笑哦？\n因为我是真的想独占你……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0234_2013_003mik", "source_sha256": "e0fc416eb5abb4bfc10533240cf1faff8b3ed79068cbf1f0a80bd4e810f9a1bb", "ja": "あっ、そろそろみたい。ミキ行ってくるね！\n楽しかったの～☆", "zh": "啊，好像差不多到时间了。美希先走啦！\n玩得很开心哦～☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0234_2014_p", "source_sha256": "51cdeb03eb9a58898a38b21caa6e17a874da36afe0b5078bd3fca35dc663c058", "ja": "（その後、美希は完璧に撮影をこなしてみせた。\nどうも、からかわれたみたいだな……やれやれ）", "zh": "（之后，美希完美地完成了拍摄。看来她是故意逗我玩的……真是的。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
